{
  "info": {
    "name": "Pokechain · Collector Crypt custody flow",
    "description": "Plays the parties outside the app: Pokechain's warehouse (operator), Collector Crypt (the vault) and the carrier. It also shows the Solana and trace calls the operator relies on. Nothing here talks to the real Collector Crypt; the app serves mocks with the real request shapes.\n\nInbound demo:\n1. In the app, fill in the Submit form (photos, declared value, shipping, declarations). Its evidence is hashed and SlabVault.requestSubmission creates submission #N, Pending.\n2. Set `submissionId`, `grader` and `certNumber`, then send **1**, **2** and **3** in order. The app's tracker moves at each step and mints the token after 3.\n3. Send **4** to show the Solana record the operator checked.\n\nOutbound demo:\n4. In the app, the token's current owner clicks Ship to me. Pokechain asks Collector Crypt to ship (redemption CCR-…).\n5. Set `redemptionId` (or send **6**, which stores it), then send **7** (in transit) and **8** (lost) or **9** (delivered).\n6. Send **10** for the full cross-chain trace.\n\nbaseUrl defaults to http://localhost:3000.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "http://localhost:3000"
    },
    {
      "key": "submissionId",
      "value": "1"
    },
    {
      "key": "grader",
      "value": "PSA"
    },
    {
      "key": "certNumber",
      "value": "72862688"
    },
    {
      "key": "assetId",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "escrowWallet",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "tokenId",
      "value": "1"
    },
    {
      "key": "redemptionId",
      "value": "CCR-00001"
    },
    {
      "key": "rpcUrl",
      "value": "http://127.0.0.1:8545"
    },
    {
      "key": "evidenceHash",
      "value": ""
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Inbound: collector → Pokechain → Collector Crypt → token",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "0 · Upload intake evidence (photos → evidenceHash)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [],
            "body": {
              "mode": "formdata",
              "formdata": [
                {
                  "key": "meta",
                  "type": "text",
                  "value": "{\"grader\": \"{{grader}}\", \"certNumber\": \"{{certNumber}}\", \"declaredValueCents\": 263400, \"condition\": {\"caseCracked\": false, \"caseScratched\": false, \"labelDamaged\": false, \"notes\": \"\"}, \"shipping\": {\"method\": \"courier\", \"carrier\": \"SingPost\", \"tracking\": \"RR123456789SG\"}, \"declarations\": {\"owner\": true, \"authentic\": true, \"terms\": true}, \"submittedBy\": \"0x70997970C51812dc3A010C7d01b50e0d17dc79C8\", \"source\": \"new\"}"
                },
                {
                  "key": "front",
                  "type": "file",
                  "src": []
                },
                {
                  "key": "back",
                  "type": "file",
                  "src": []
                },
                {
                  "key": "label",
                  "type": "file",
                  "src": []
                }
              ]
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/evidence",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "evidence"
              ]
            },
            "description": "What the app's Submit form does first. Pick three image files for front, back and label. Returns evidenceHash = keccak256 of the manifest (each photo's keccak256 + declarations); the app then passes it to SlabVault.requestSubmission. The in-app form is the easier way to do this step."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('evidenceHash', pm.response.json().evidenceHash);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "1 · Pokechain warehouse receives the slab (markReceived)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/chain/receive",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "chain",
                "receive"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Operator tx: SlabVault.markReceived, after checking the stored intake evidence still hashes to the evidenceHash on-chain and describes this cert. Otherwise it sends rejectSubmission.",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"submissionId\": \"{{submissionId}}\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Evidence: re-verify against the on-chain hash",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/evidence/{{evidenceHash}}",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "evidence",
                "{{evidenceHash}}"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Re-hashes the stored manifest and photos. verified.all is true only if nothing changed since submission."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "2 · Pokechain forwards it to Collector Crypt (markForwarded)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/chain/forward",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "chain",
                "forward"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Operator tx: SlabVault.markForwarded(submissionId, ciphertext, commitment). The parcel details are encrypted to Collector Crypt's public key (read from SlabVault.encryptionKey(custodian)); only the ciphertext and keccak256(salt ‖ message) go on-chain. The response shows Pokechain's own copy of the tracking number.",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"submissionId\": \"{{submissionId}}\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "2a · Collector Crypt inbox: decrypt incoming parcels",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/collector-crypt/inbox",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "collector-crypt",
                "inbox"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Simulated Collector Crypt: reads every SubmissionForwarded event addressed to its wallet and decrypts it with its private key. Compare each item's ciphertext (what anyone sees on-chain) with decrypted (what only CC sees)."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "2b · Dispute check: verifyForwardCommitment on-chain",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/chain/dispute",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "chain",
                "dispute"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Pokechain reveals the message and salt it committed to; SlabVault.verifyForwardCommitment (an eth_call into the contract) returns verified: true only if they match the on-chain commitment.",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"submissionId\": \"{{submissionId}}\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "3 · Collector Crypt vaults it and mints its NFT to Pokechain's escrow",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/collector-crypt/intake",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "collector-crypt",
                "intake"
              ]
            },
            "description": "What Collector Crypt does when the parcel arrives. It vaults the slab and mints its Solana NFT straight to Pokechain's escrow wallet. Within seconds the app checks it (Solana getAsset) and calls SlabVault.mintSlab.",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"grader\": \"{{grader}}\",\n  \"certNumber\": \"{{certNumber}}\",\n  \"depositorRef\": \"pokechain-submission-{{submissionId}}\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const c = pm.response.json().card;",
                  "pm.test('NFT minted to Pokechain escrow', () => pm.expect(c.vaultStatus).to.eql('Vaulted'));",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('assetId', c.assetId);",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('escrowWallet', c.owner);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "4 · Solana getAsset: the record the operator checks",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/mock-solana",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "mock-solana"
              ]
            },
            "description": "DAS JSON-RPC, same shape as Helius. The operator requires: owner == Pokechain escrow, collection == Collector Crypt, attribute 'Cert number' == submitted cert, 'Vault status' == Vaulted, not burnt.",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"jsonrpc\": \"2.0\",\n  \"id\": 1,\n  \"method\": \"getAsset\",\n  \"params\": {\n    \"id\": \"{{assetId}}\"\n  }\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Operator: verify custody and mint (mintSlab)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/chain/mint",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "chain",
                "mint"
              ]
            },
            "description": "The app polls this itself. Returns minted | awaiting_custodian | mismatch, plus the checks it ran.",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"submissionId\": \"{{submissionId}}\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Collector Crypt: card lookup",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/collector-crypt/cards/{{grader}}/{{certNumber}}",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "collector-crypt",
                "cards",
                "{{grader}}",
                "{{certNumber}}"
              ]
            },
            "description": ""
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Collector Crypt: every vaulted slab",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/collector-crypt/intake",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "collector-crypt",
                "intake"
              ]
            },
            "description": ""
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Solana getAssetsByOwner: everything in Pokechain's escrow",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/mock-solana",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "mock-solana"
              ]
            },
            "description": "",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"jsonrpc\": \"2.0\",\n  \"id\": 1,\n  \"method\": \"getAssetsByOwner\",\n  \"params\": {\n    \"ownerAddress\": \"{{escrowWallet}}\"\n  }\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Outbound: owner withdraws → Collector Crypt ships",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "5 · (normally via the app) Ship a redeemed token",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/chain/ship",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "chain",
                "ship"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Only works after the owner's requestRedemption, and only with the exact address whose keccak256 they put on-chain. The operator asks Collector Crypt (as NFT holder) to ship, then records SlabVault.markShipped(tokenId, redemptionId, carrier, tracking).",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"tokenId\": \"{{tokenId}}\",\n  \"shipTo\": \"Misty, 2 Cerulean Gym Road, Cerulean City 000002\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "6 · Collector Crypt card lookup (stores redemptionId)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/collector-crypt/cards/{{grader}}/{{certNumber}}",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "collector-crypt",
                "cards",
                "{{grader}}",
                "{{certNumber}}"
              ]
            },
            "description": ""
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const r = pm.response.json(); if (r.redemptionId) pm.collectionVariables.set('redemptionId', r.redemptionId);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "7 · Carrier scan: in transit",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/collector-crypt/redemptions/{{redemptionId}}/events",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "collector-crypt",
                "redemptions",
                "{{redemptionId}}",
                "events"
              ]
            },
            "description": "",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"status\": \"in_transit\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "8 · Carrier: parcel lost",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/collector-crypt/redemptions/{{redemptionId}}/events",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "collector-crypt",
                "redemptions",
                "{{redemptionId}}",
                "events"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Also written onto the Solana NFT (Vault status → Lost). The owner then files SlabVault.reportLost in the app.",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"status\": \"lost\",\n  \"note\": \"No scan for 10 days, parcel declared lost\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "9 · Carrier: delivered",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/collector-crypt/redemptions/{{redemptionId}}/events",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "collector-crypt",
                "redemptions",
                "{{redemptionId}}",
                "events"
              ]
            },
            "description": "",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"status\": \"delivered\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Collector Crypt: redemption tracking",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/collector-crypt/redemptions/{{redemptionId}}",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "collector-crypt",
                "redemptions",
                "{{redemptionId}}"
              ]
            },
            "description": ""
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Solana getSignaturesForAsset: the NFT's history",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/mock-solana",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "mock-solana"
              ]
            },
            "description": "",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"jsonrpc\": \"2.0\",\n  \"id\": 1,\n  \"method\": \"getSignaturesForAsset\",\n  \"params\": {\n    \"id\": \"{{assetId}}\"\n  }\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Trace",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "10 · Full cross-chain trace of a token",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/trace/{{tokenId}}",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "trace",
                "{{tokenId}}"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Polygon SlabVault events (inbound trail, mint, every Transfer, redemption, shipping, lost) + Solana getAsset/getSignaturesForAsset + Collector Crypt tracking, in one document. Also at /trace/{tokenId} in the app."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Polygon / Hardhat JSON-RPC",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "eth_blockNumber",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"jsonrpc\": \"2.0\",\n  \"id\": 1,\n  \"method\": \"eth_blockNumber\",\n  \"params\": []\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{rpcUrl}}",
              "host": [
                "{{rpcUrl}}"
              ]
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}